      "id": "canonical_entry",
      "text": "Lil Blunt: The Smoke Realm is a free 2D side-scrolling platformer and arcade score-chaser playable in a web browser on desktop or mobile. Built in Godot 4 and exported to HTML5, the Wild West video game stars the mascot Lil Blunt, who throws axes and faces Tax Collector enemies across three stages, Smoke Realm, Crystal Caverns and Gold Rush, each ending in a boss. No download, no account and no crypto wallet, with nothing to buy.",
